              "line": 3,
              "heading": "CloudWay 24: Employee Insurance Policy Overview"
            },
            "text": "CloudWay 24 provides comprehensive group insurance coverage for all employees, ensuring their health, safety, and well-being while on duty and beyond. Insurance benefits are categorized based on employee roles due to the varying risk profiles associated with their responsibilities."
          }
        ],
